WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.150
- Is it true that you're also
a video game character now?

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.470
I mean, I think you've made it when you're

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:06.300
a video game character.
- Yeah you've arrived.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.619
- I'm just saying.
- This is it,

00:00:07.619 --> 00:00:08.891
this is my last public appearance

00:00:08.891 --> 00:00:09.724
and that's it.

00:00:09.724 --> 00:00:11.520
- This is my real question.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.353
And you have to be,

00:00:12.353 --> 00:00:14.670
(audience cheering)

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:16.860
you have to be honest.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.950
Have you ever played yourself in the game?

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.429
Like you're-
- Yes.

00:00:21.429 --> 00:00:23.929
- Okay, I was like, don't lie.

00:00:25.603 --> 00:00:26.640
- Yes, yes.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.520
- I would play me, I'd
be like, I'm killing it.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.800
- He's also really good as well.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.700
So he's like, I just give
the ball to him all the time.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.000
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.179
- There was a time when my
girlfriend came back home

00:00:40.179 --> 00:00:42.750
and I mean, it puts a
whole different meaning

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.050
to her finding you playing with yourself,

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:49.710
but it's with myself.
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:51.589
And she came back.

00:00:51.589 --> 00:00:54.090
(all laughing)

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:56.360
- So your girlfriend came in.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:58.181
- She was like, "Not again".

00:00:58.181 --> 00:01:00.691
(all laughing)

00:01:00.691 --> 00:01:02.091
- Yeah, it's rather embarrassing.

00:01:02.091 --> 00:01:04.069
- Oh my, and there's nothing
worse than that bust.

00:01:04.069 --> 00:01:05.101
I mean.

00:01:05.101 --> 00:01:06.981
(all laughing)

00:01:06.981 --> 00:01:11.430
(all laughing audience clapping)

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.880
Nothing worse.
- I love this (inaudible).

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.910
- I mean, my children have caught me

00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:16.890
watching old sketches of mine

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.980
howling and laughing
and at myself, nothing.

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.300
- The good days.
- It's humiliating.

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.301
- Oh my God.

00:01:22.301 --> 00:01:23.134
It's awesome.

00:01:23.134 --> 00:01:24.491
Watching your own video.
- I still watch it.

00:01:24.491 --> 00:01:25.324
- They're like, you can start it over.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:27.233
Mortified.
- You know what?

00:01:27.233 --> 00:01:28.066
You missed this part.

00:01:28.066 --> 00:01:28.899
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:28.899 --> 00:01:30.286
Look, come watch this,
this is the best bit.

00:01:30.286 --> 00:01:31.443
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

